里将是你开启学术新征程的绝佳舞台。无论你志在攻读硕士学位，还是渴望直接投身博士研究，深大集成学院都向你敞开大门，快来抓住这次难得的机会，书写属于你的学术篇章吧！</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzqOibT2g96nZHYvicQrlTaXkYvsYUhAon69UhzM6Elvnu9AhrFBkj5dyYop1QLLcuic0oU7nwNZccIGmp0ggBT3qNDNg6GmiapCB3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名信息</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.招生对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1）申请人必须是具有推荐免试授权高校且有意申请攻读我校集成电路学院</span><span><span>研究生或直接攻读博士学位研究生（直博生）的应届本科毕业生（本科专业为理工类专业），并获得所在院校推荐免试资格。</span></span></p><p><span>2）考生录取当年入学前（具体期限由招生单位规定）必须取得国家承认的本科毕业证书。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.推免预报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>报名截止时间为</span><span><strong><span>2026年9月17日</span></strong></span><span>。报名成功后进行分批次面试，具体面试时间将由招生老师邮件或电话通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.报名方法</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1）有意向申请我校的推免生须在“深圳大学2027年硕士研究生推免生预报名系统”进行预报名，网址：http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm，并须如实填写本人有效的手机号码、邮箱和QQ号，方便接收后续面试通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2）学生报名时，需提交就读学校和专业、成绩排名、外语水平、科研经历、科研成果和个人简历等证明材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3）预报名后请加入2027级推免生招生咨询QQ群：600807575（见下方二维码）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4）国家研招系统报名</span></span></p><p><span><span>获得推免资格的考生在教育部中国研招网“推免服务系统”（http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）注册报名，系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>深圳大学集成电路学院由</span><strong><span><span>中国科学院院士毛军发</span></span></strong><span><span>领衔</span></span><span>，依托深圳本土高校首个全国重点实验室——</span><strong><span><span>射频异质异构集成全国重点实验室</span></span></strong><span>，以及ESI全球前1‰学科，入选教育部101计划，行业头部企业协同育人等资源优势。致力于为有志投身集成电路前沿赛道的学子，铺设一条“本科进实验室、战高水平竞赛、融国际前沿、获名企实战”的卓越成长通道。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzoM07vGK27n4bJb77CufcQj6gnSMkZrNLZFfGiaqtich4cTibYsf7XJcukajjjSCCB4DF6h4gicPN9DaNANfjicfASrUDBW3cG3vEM4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>同时学院</span><strong><span><span>深度联动中兴微电子、万里眼、佰维存储</span></span></strong><span>等头部企业共建产学研用基地，精准对标粤港澳大湾区集成电路产业高质量发展与自主可控战略需求，构建</span><strong><span><span>“基础研究-创新驱动-技术攻关-成果转化”</span></span></strong><span>全体系链条，聚焦集成电路关键核心技术研发，持续为国家“芯片自强”积蓄核心力量，铺就学子直通产业前沿的赛道。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>师资力量</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/g58bmlUCfzpN12EYHESDuibWY4t6Ddz2MHRiaTic9Z4OZQfBv2Nowe0FRTRA2jcMMgPWgSeU0OicblfxzibRiaMKGxMjica71eEOtnfibr90S5wfZdw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>毛军发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>中国科学院院士，射频异质异构集成全国重点实验室主任，IEEE Fellow，</span><span>中国电子学会微波分会主任委员</span><span>。</span></span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span>获国家科技进步奖一等奖、</span><span>国家自然科学奖二等奖、国家技术发明奖二等奖、国家科技进步奖二等奖各一项。</span></p><p><span>主要从事高速电路互连与射频电子封装等领域的科研和教学工作。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院由</span><strong><span><span>毛军发院士</span></span></strong><span>领衔</span></p><p><span>汇聚了包括</span><strong><span>国家级领军人才</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>罗讯教授、何文龙教授、郭慧民教授</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>国家级青年人才赵晓锦教授</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>葛磊、陈梦琳教</span></strong><strong><span>授</span></strong><span>等</span></p><p><span>在内的</span><strong><span><span>55人</span></span></strong><span>专职师资团队</span></p><p><strong><span><span>60</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>%以上</span></span></strong><span>具有海外教育经历</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzo2zHMlrYo0mPsVZO6atUED1icvuhk7R4lFs6LCQRx0A4Pr152udmLweV3lIm8JTfXhJicFUXqCDgnb0ogcKpRWEpZ0bX0SXDtUE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>罗讯</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzoGg74IFdm2WyiaFyBugJSnN2xFSUVKebBW8mXD6IeeaTOoCheAic1weA1os5dw2JfdWDNRePeC6VZxH3TwKMeuDsPkwhV9xcN2Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>何文龙</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzpZ4qcwyTJCPibiccDaC0b1XZUNdmmHP0GIWlCfcaF7aiboXicxsXBoB3oNDr8ct2akCxMKWd9DtwoHW5je1XrCYlZUg1zzDFZV0JU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>郭慧民</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzriawyRmpY5ic60JibViawtQjbFrMXugLkMhJia48mv0vT78sBh99hmfMWGicHV3gh4yjpvibyIBBczwZD2Y9oibGsIQrUfIGdmLSG19mw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>葛磊</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzr8HgfyicUjia3jfiaNNSEDibL3Pk4vaVw0LrogoUJOJx4zCSxSzdoxGU46JTkfSqkiblqDTdAFCfUkicZrdTaLqxk7gED7NzA4e1ALU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>赵晓锦</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzoYf3HoROokvUkXz0uSZtC7cN7J5MIc5J7kqmibrpqiaSnKW0LVDsia7ZOX5JEN7AVhF9XA0e8rchbuqH4T35n7NWpXlwfiakzEyic0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>陈梦琳</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>于人才高地上深耕教学创新</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院跻身</span></span><strong><span><span>教育部集成电路领域</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>“101计划”核心教材编写单位</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>构建了覆盖设计、工艺</span></span></p><p><span><span>智能应用的全模块课程体系</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人才培养</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院坚持以学生为本，着力培养基础知识扎实、专业素养高、创新实践能力强，具有家国情怀和国际视野的集成电路领域领军人才及行业骨干。学院构建本硕博一体化贯通培养体系，本科生即有机会依托射频异质异构集成全国重点实验室等顶尖平台参与EDA大模型、数字射频芯片等尖端科研任务，通过“本科进实验室、战高水平竞赛、融国际前沿、获名企实战”的卓越成长通道，实现从本科到博士的阶梯式能力跃升。目前，博士研究生70余人，硕士研究生300余人，本科生930余人。学院与华为海思、中兴微电子、中芯国际、比亚迪、华大九天等头部企业共建产学研用基地，实现“零距离”协同育人，学生可深入企业参与芯片设计、制造全流程实战，精准覆盖产业急需的技能谱系。学院每年举办IEEE国际无线年会、中国微波周、大师讲坛、“芯启未来”学术沙龙等品牌学术活动，邀请国内外院士、顶尖学者及产业专家开展高水平交流。学院注重国际化培养，主办第七届IEEE射频与天线技术国际学术研讨会等国际会议，鼓励学生参与国际前沿对话，为投身国家“芯片自强”战略积蓄核心力量。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>就业去向</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>集成电路学院培养了一大批优秀毕业生，在各个领域发挥着重要作用。近三年，学院研究生的平均就业率约为94%。其中，大部分的同学进入企业单位，包括以华为、中兴、中芯国际、腾讯、大疆、比亚迪、华大九天等为代表的知名企业。还有部分进入高校工作，如香港科技大学、香港理工大学、深圳大学等高校以及中科院系统、鹏城实验室及深圳先进院等知名科研平台。</span></p><p><span>就业地区方面，北上广深等一线城市吸引了超7成的毕业生。另有少部分毕业生选择出境深造，如布里斯托大学、香港科技大学、内华达大学里诺分校等继续科研发展。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>电话：0755-26534393</span></p><p><span>邮箱：shenzx1@szu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>QQ咨询群：600807575</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzpqfobHCrOD5OVZK4FoML8k5udIYmU6ReThOzPnrzYNrM0y3mplJC4W5icyWS71W10IjSBtYKmyJPfuYibFEZtNeCnUaa9fkftyQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>▲</span></span><span>长按识别查看QQ群二维码</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>集成电路学院（2027）咨询群</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/g58bmlUCfzpjNnGShYKVXXS5KM0vDgPbSjRlPeTDtDwTLa0sUacGnu4rzpgWm0XCNebMAhDV77hnHZKiarPRNZfdcsOQl3ibdaSS16hMbCeVU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>点击“</span><span>阅读原文</span><span>”，查看深圳大学研招网更多信息。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/g58bmlUCfzpnuBoqTgy3znR66txUY12dDu3Kup5HmN3x5p5g0zO4qZyMX5hCobGSYwJFq9sAHsZ7UhnIw7CanR9NDyWrCEClEFjLZO8Lz3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=8\"/></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>来源：深圳大学集成电路学院</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>责编：黄海云、龙艺、陈蔚</span></span></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"bfd5e2f906bfe3805d0d375928b8655bbf2ac69d0bea57830ee2c3385730a47e","textLength":2099,"sourceSha256":"c03f938ba4867504e8d249e7fdcf0c9e3c719abcf8091d91de1e8136b9641575","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5468a97a88bed7c5d149","title":"2026年深圳大学集成电路学院2027级硕士推免预报名正在进行中","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:35.811859+00:00"}
